{
  "slug": "build-with-wordpress",
  "name": "Build With Wordpress",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Craft production-grade WordPress sites and applications. Everything from themes and plugins to commerce and deployment.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill** and **3 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `site-specification` (Extract comprehensive site specifications from simple descriptions)\n- **Commands** (3): `design-site` (Design a WordPress site, starting with a clear design direction and style tokens, then intial page layouts, followed…), `preview-designs` (Generate or regenerate design preview options for a site), `quick-build` (Creates a WordPress block theme from a description with an index.html landing page template and deploys it to…)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install build-with-wordpress@claude-plugins-official` from `Automattic/claude-code-wordpress.com`.",
